OL,3,GNEWSARare duck breeding success gives
OL,4,Ahope for species
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix of the world's rarest ducks have
OL,7,Freached adulthood after
OL,8,Fconservationists successfully raised
OL,9,Fthem from eggs collected in the wild.
OL,11,FThe Madagascar pochards were hatched
OL,12,Fafter their eggs were carried 44km (27
OL,13,Fmiles) on foot before being taken to a
OL,14,Fspecialist breeding centre in
OL,15,FMadagascar. The species was once
OL,16,Fthought to be extinct before being
OL,17,Frediscovered in 2006.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
