OL,3,GNEWSARare duck breeding success gives
OL,4,Ahope for species
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork was carried out by the
OL,7,FJersey-based Durrell Wildlife
OL,8,FConservation Trust, which said the
OL,9,Fsuccess had given scientists another
OL,10,Fway to protect the species when nests
OL,11,Fwere threatened.
OL,13,FRoland Digby, a conservation biologist
OL,14,Fat Durrell, said: "This is an important
OL,15,Fmilestone for the Madagascar pochard."
